  "prefLabel": "Pod 103.04 Office Hours, Office Location, Mailing Address, and Telephone",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pod 103.04 Office Hours, Office Location, Mailing Address, and Telephone.\n\n(a) The board's offices are located at:\n\nBoard of Podiatry\n\nOffice of Professional Licensure and Certification\n\n7 Eagle Square\n\nConcord, New Hampshire 03301.\n\n(b) The board’s offices are open to the public Monday through Friday, excluding holidays, from 8:00 a.m. to 4:00 p.m.\n\n(c) Correspondence shall be addressed to the board at the location stated in Pod 103.04(a).\n\n(d) The board's telephone number is (603) 271-2152.\n\nSource. #7816, eff 1-7-03; ss by #14372, eff 9-19-25",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/pod100-500.html"
